# Lychee Link Checker Ignore File
# These URLs are excluded from link checking to avoid false positives

# External services that may rate-limit or block CI bots
https://www.meetup.com/*
https://meetup.com/*
https://api.allorigins.win/*
https://tally.so/*
https://nol-kky-shop.fourthwall.com/*
https://givebutter.com/*

# Social media links (often block automated requests)
https://twitter.com/*
https://x.com/*
https://linkedin.com/*
https://www.linkedin.com/*

# Google services (require authentication or block bots)
https://fonts.googleapis.com/*
https://fonts.gstatic.com/*

# CDN resources (always available, no need to check)
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/*
https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/*

# Localhost URLs in documentation
http://localhost:*
http://127.0.0.1:*

# GitHub API and raw content (rate limited)
https://api.github.com/*
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/*

# Mail links
mailto:*
